@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-access-token
@imageId = 18fdcc69-269d-4c1a-9123-56f83cd36d50

### Upload a custom widget picture (Configuration.Manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/layouts/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=widget-picture

--widget-picture
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="picture.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./picture.png
--widget-picture--

### Read an uploaded custom widget picture (404 for an unknown id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/layouts/images/{{imageId}}

### Public active layouts
GET {{baseUrl}}/layouts

### Management configuration (Configuration.Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/layouts/manage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save (Configuration.Manage); use the revision from the management response
POST {{baseUrl}}/layouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "revision": 0,
  "defaultLayout": "default",
  "layouts": [
    {
      "id": "default",
      "name": "Default",
      "badges": [
        { "id": "development", "text": "Under development", "position": "top-right", "width": 180 }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "width": "full",
          "widgets": [{ "id": "header", "type": "core.header", "hamburgerPosition": "right" }]
        },
        {
          "rows": 1,
          "columns": 1,
          "cssClass": "page-body",
          "widgets": [{ "id": "content", "type": "core.content", "cssClass": "page-content", "borderless": true, "noMargin": true, "noPadding": true }]
        },
        {
          "width": "full",
          "widgets": [{ "id": "footer", "type": "core.footer" }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "assignments": []
}

### Latest live news by audit creation time
GET {{baseUrl}}/widgets/news

### Latest visible downloads across folders
GET {{baseUrl}}/widgets/downloads

### Public chat messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/widgets/chat

### Post plain-text chat (authenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/widgets/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text": "Hello from the chat widget"}

### Sanitize custom widget content
POST {{baseUrl}}/widgets/sanitize
Content-Type: application/json

{"content": "<p>Custom widget <strong>content</strong></p>"}

### Latest published forum messages (when Forum is installed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/widgets/posts?limit=5
